{"Case-sensitive blacklist comparison allows bypass - guest emails are compared as-is while blacklistedGuestEmails is normalized to lowercase, allowing mixed-case emails to bypass the blacklist": 0.987575352191925, "The variable isTeamAdminOrOwner uses && (AND) instead of || (OR), effectively reducing the check to owner-only and locking out team admins who are not owners": 0.9782774448394775, "Wrong set of emails passed to sendAddGuestsEmails - guests (raw user input) is passed instead of uniqueGuests (de-duplicated list), causing existing attendees to receive wrong email type if their email is in the submission": 0.992081880569458, "Empty initial value [''] allows submitting an empty field - multiEmailValue.length === 0 is never true on first render, causing validation error instead of no-op when clicking Add immediately": 0.8449900150299072, "Tooltip content is a hardcoded English string instead of a translated value, breaking localization for non-English users": 0.9410805702209473, "ZAddGuestsInputSchema is recreated on every render, causing unnecessary allocation overhead - should be moved to module scope": 0.24924661219120026, "Silent error swallowing hides actual failure cause - catch block discards the actual err object, making email delivery failures impossible to debug in production": 0.9545128345489502, "No booking status guard - guests can be added to cancelled/rejected bookings since the handler never checks booking.status": 0.98847895860672, "Add Guests menu item shown for cancelled/rejected/pending bookings - add_members is unconditionally pushed into editBookingActions instead of being conditionally included only for confirmed bookings": 0.9587974548339844, "Misleading error message when all emails are already attendees - emails_must_be_unique_valid is shown when the actual reason is that every submitted address is already an attendee": 0.9724445343017578}